- *   <li>Entity.move() reads from deferred buffer instead of calling push() directly</li>
+ *   <li>Detection: Read all entity positions, compute AABB overlaps (parallel read)</li>
+ *   <li>Impulse aggregation: Compute push vectors per pair (serial SCC)</li>
+ *   <li>Position update: Apply impulses + Entity.move() (parallel self-write)</li>
  * </ol>
+ * <p>This requires deeper hooks into Entity.move() / CollisionUtil and is
+ * deferred to a future PR.
  *
- * @see EntityTaskBuilder current (conservative) entity task generation
+ * @see DeferredImpulseBuffer actual impulse deferral implementation
+ * @see EntityTaskBuilder generates entity tasks + collision_flush
  */
